ABLONEfQ","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-22T15:24:09Z","updated_at":"2026-07-22T15:24:09Z","body":"Might be an optimization. When you delete a directory, the signal would have to be emitted for each file recursively, which could be slow.\r\n\r\nThough there is also `folder_removed` signal. Using it you could check if the folder is parent directory of the file.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5048059005/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5048080851","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121599#issuecomment-5048080851","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121599","id":5048080851,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABLOOZ0w","user":{"login":"bluebirdsan","id":60063904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDYzOTA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60063904?v=4","gravat